<<else>>
	"Do you need a hand?" you ask.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Alex smiles as you take the bucket. "Thanks. Will be faster with both of us."
<br><br>

You help Alex carry feed across the yard, spilling it over the fence and into the troughs.

<<if $farm_work.pigs_fed gte 6>>
	The <<farm_text_many pig>> eat the feed with gusto, but by the end<span class="green"> lie on their sides, content.</span>
<<else>>
	<span class="blue">The <<farm_text_many pig>> devour the feed. Seems they're still hungry.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if _fullyNaked or dangerEvent(1.25)>>
	<<if !$weekly.farmNauseaEvent and $rng gte 86 and playerIsPregnant() and playerAwareTheyArePregnant() and between(pregnancyProgress(getPlayerPregnancy()), 0.1, 0.3)>>
		As you lift the bucket, you catch a strong whiff of the slop within. Immediately, your stomach churns,
		and you all but drop the bucket in your haste to get away from the smell. You stumble back a few steps,
		trying to will your stomach to settle.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Farm Pigs Feed Nausea]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<!--
		When feeding the pigs with Alex, Alex will have a chance of being targeted instead of the PC, with the odds split 50 / 50. If the PC gets harassed, there will be an automatic Tending check. Passing it will raise the Pig's Respect, while failing will cause them to be saved by Alex (+Stress, +Dominance). The Pig will also only make 1 attempt to grab the PC before Alex notices.

		The skill checks happen automatically because Alex is there to help the PC, even if they fail the check. This removes the need for the "Scream for help" option. Alex's presence also reduces the severity of failure
		and makes the Tending checks slightly easier. -->
	<<elseif random(0, 1) is 0>>
		<!-- First tending check is for normal Respect. Second tending check is for very low Respect. -->
		<<set _checkResults to [
			$hairlength gte random(300, 500),
			not _topless,
			not _bottomless,
			currentSkillValue("tending") gte random(0, 500),
			currentSkillValue("tending") gte random(0, 1000),
			currentSkillValue("skulduggery") gte random(100, 300)
		]>>
		<<set _attemptOne to random(0, 2)>>
		<<if ($settings.bestialityEnabled or $farm_work.pig.monster is true) and _checkResults[_attemptOne]>>
			Something catches your
			<<if _attemptOne is 0>> <<hairDetails>>
			<<elseif _attemptOne is 1>> _top.name
			<<else>> _bottom.name
			<</if>>
			as you turn away from the trough.

			<<if $farm.beasts.pigs lte -20 and $rng gte 51>>
				One of the <<farm_text_many pig>> has reached over the fence.
				<<if $farm_work.pig.monster is true>>"You're not finished here," <<farm_he pig>> says. <</if>>
				<<farm_He pig>> tries to pull you inside.
				<br><br>

				<<if _checkResults[4]>>
					"Down!" you say. You tug against <<farm_his pig>> <<= $farm_work.pig.monster is true ? "arm," : "snout,">>
					<span class="green">and <<farm_he pig>> hesitates.</span> <<farm_He pig>> spots Alex grabbing a rake, and decides to let you go.
					<<farm_pigs 3>><<ggrespect>>
					<br><br>

					"Down!" You hear a shout. Alex runs over with a rake, stopping when <<he>> sees the pig back away from you. He laughs. "Good job! I knew you had it in you."
					<<npcincr Alex love 1>><<npcincr Alex dom -1>><<glove>><<ldom>>
					<br><br>
				<<else>>
					"D-Down!" you say. You tug against <<farm_his pig>> <<= $farm_work.pig.monster is true ? "arm," : "snout,">> but your voice trembles and the <<farm_text pig>> ignores you. <<farm_He pig>> yanks you over the fence.
					<!-- Bonus pain if the PC was grabbed by their hair. -->
					<<if _attemptOne is 0>> <<violence 1>><<gpain>> <</if>>
					<br><br>

					"Down!" You hear a shout, and Alex bonks the <<farm_text pig>> on <<farm_his pig>> head with a rake.
					He laughs and helps you up. "Sorry about that," <<he>> says. "Try to be more firm when they get frisky like that."
					<<stress 6>><<npcincr Alex dom 1>><<gstress>><<gdom>>
					<br><br>
				<</if>>
				<<link [[Next|Farm Work]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
				<br>
			<<else>>
				One of the <<farm_text_many pig>> has stuck <<farm_his pig>> <<= $farm_work.pig.monster is true ? "arm" : "snout">> through the fence, and grasps your
				<<if _attemptOne is 0>> hair
				<<else>> clothing
				<</if>>
				in <<farm_his pig>> <<= $farm_work.pig.monster is true ? "hand." : "mouth.">>
				<br><br>

				<<if _checkResults[3]>>
					"Down!" you say, <span class="green">your voice firm and sure.</span> The <<farm_text pig>> releases your
					<<if _attemptOne is 0>> <<hairDetails>>,
					<<elseif _attemptOne is 1>> _top.name,
					<<else>> _bottom.name,
					<</if>>
					and returns to its feed.
					<<farm_pigs 1>><<grespect>>
					<br><br>

					Alex empties the last bucket into the pig pen. "Good job," <<he>> says. You nod.
					<<npcincr Alex love 1>><<npcincr Alex dom -1>><<glove>><<ldom>>
					<br><br>

					<<link [[Next|Farm Work]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
					<br>

				<<else>>
					"D-down!" you say, <span class="red">but your voice shakes.</span>

					<<if _attemptOne is 0>>
						The <<farm_text pig>> sees Alex approaching you, and tugs on your hair one last time.<<gpain>><<violence 1>>
					<<elseif _attemptOne is 1>>
						The <<farm_text pig>> sees Alex approaching you, and tugs on your clothes one last time.
						<<set _top.integrity -= 50>>
						<<if _top.integrity lte 0>>
							<<farm_He pig>> tears away your _top.name, exposing your <<= _topUnder?.name || "<<undertop>>">>.
							<<farm_He pig>> trots into the middle of the pen, pleased with <<farm_his pig>> acquisition.
						<<else>>
							<<farm_He pig>> rips away a piece of fabric.
						<</if>>
					<<else>>
						The <<farm_text pig>> sees Alex approaching you, and tugs on your clothes one last time.
						<<set _bottom.integrity -= 50>>
						<<if _bottom.integrity lte 0>>
							<<farm_He pig>> tears away your _bottom.name, exposing your <<= _bottomUnder?.name || "<<undies>>">>.
							<<farm_He pig>> trots into the middle of the pen, pleased with <<farm_his pig>> acquisition.
						<<else>>
							<<farm_He pig>> rips away a piece of fabric.
						<</if>>
					<</if>>
					<<integritycheck no_text>><<exposure>>
					<br><br>

					Alex empties the last bucket into the pig pen. "Is everything alright?" <<he>> asks. You nod.
					<<npcincr Alex dom 1>><<gdom>>
					<br><br>

					<<link [[Next|Farm Work]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
					<br>

				<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<<elseif _checkResults[5]>>
			As you turn away from the trough, you feel something brush against your
			<<if _attemptOne is 0>> <<hairDetails>>
			<<elseif _attemptOne is 1>> chest.
			<<else>> waist.
			<</if>>
			<span class="teal">One of the <<farm_text_many pig>> just tried to grab you.</span> "No! Bad pig!" you say. The <<farm_text pig>> eyes you. Seeing Alex approaching you, <<farm_he pig>> backs away.
			<<farm_pigs 1>><<grespect>>
			<br><br>

			Alex empties the last bucket into the pig pen. "You okay?" <<he>> asks. You nod.
			<<npcincr Alex love 1>><<npcincr Alex dom 1>><<glove>><<gdom>>
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Farm Work]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			As you turn away from the trough, you feel something brush against your
			<<if _attemptOne is 0>> <<hairDetails>>.
			<<elseif _attemptOne is 1 and _checkResults[1]>> _top.name.
			<<elseif _attemptOne is 1>> chest.
			<<elseif _attemptOne is 2 and _checkResults[2]>> _bottom.name.
			<<else>> waist.
			<</if>>
			<span class="red">You don't know what it was.</span><<gstress>><<stress 6>>
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Farm Work]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		"Down!" Alex says behind you. You turn. One of the <<farm_text pig>>s has grasped Alex's
		<<if $pronoun is "f">>skirt<<else>>shorts<</if>> in <<farm_his pig>> <<= $farm_work.pig.monster is true ? "hands" : "mouth">>.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Scold the <<farm_text pig>>|Farm Pigs Alex Scold]]>><</link>><<tendingdifficulty 1 600>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Watch|Farm Pigs Alex Watch]]>><<npcincr Alex lust 1>><<arousal 600>><</link>><<glust>><<garousal>>
		<br>

	<</if>>
<<else>>

	<<link [[Next|Farm Work]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>


:: Farm Pigs Feed
<<effects>><<wearProp "bucket">>

<<pigsOpinion>>

<!--
	PC's  with at least 14,000 Physique will be able to feed the pigs twice as fast, halving their number of required interactions. This reduces the number of times the PC can interact with them to raise their respect, so they also gain +1 Pig's Respect as compensation.
-->
<<if currentSkillValue('physique') gte 14000>>
	You pour feed into a couple of buckets and traipse across the field. The buckets are heavy, <span class="green">but no trouble for someone of your strength.</span>
	<<set $farm_work.pigs_fed += 1>><<physique 2>><<grespect>><<farm_pigs 1>>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	You pour feed into a couple of buckets and traipse across the field. Your arms ache by the time you arrive at the sty.<<physique 2>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<pass 20>>

You empty the buckets in the troughs.

<<if $farm_work.pigs_fed gte 6>>
	The <<farm_text_many pig>> eat the feed with gusto, but by the end they <span class="green">lie on their sides, content.</span>
<<else>>
	<span class="blue">The <<farm_text_many pig>> devour the feed. Seems they're still hungry.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if _fullyNaked or dangerEvent(1.25)>>
<!-- Modified for Monster People -->
	<!-- Pigs make 2 attempts at grabbing the PC's body, targeting their hair, upper clothes, or lower clothes. With a decent Skulduggery (100-300), the PC will notice the pig's first attempt, causing the pig's second attempt to automatically fail and giving +1 Pig's Respect. -->
	<<set _checkResults to [
		$hairlength gte random(300, 500),
		not _topless,
		not _bottomless,
		currentSkillValue("skulduggery") gte random(100, 300)
	]>>

	<<set _attemptOne to random(0, 2)>>
	<<set _attemptTwo to random(0, 2)>>
	<<set _grabbed to ((_checkResults[_attemptOne]) or (not _checkResults[3] and _checkResults[_attemptTwo]))>>

	<<if ($settings.bestialityEnabled or $farm_work.pig.monster is true) and !$weekly.farmNauseaEvent and $rng gte 86 and playerIsPregnant() and playerAwareTheyArePregnant() and between(pregnancyProgress(getPlayerPregnancy()), 0.1, 0.3)>>
		As you lift the bucket, you catch a strong whiff of the slop within. Immediately, your stomach churns, and you all but drop the bucket in your haste to get away from the smell. You stumble back a few steps, trying to will your stomach to settle.
		<br><br>

		<<if random(0, 2) is 0>>
			You lean on the fence for support. Closing your eyes to fight down the waves of nausea, you hear a growl from behind you. You look back to see a <<farm_text dog>> sniffing your rear.
			<<if $farm_work.dog.monster is true>> "Smells good. I like it. I want it," <<farm_he dog>> says. <</if>><<farm_He dog>> tries to mount you. You try to fend <<farm_him dog>> off, but feel too weak to resist.
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Farm Dogs Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<!-- Losing the pregnancy RNG will cause you to automatically fail the pig's Skulduggry check. -->
			You lean on the fence for support. Closing your eyes to fight down the waves of nausea, you fail to notice the <<farm_text pig>> approaching you. As you open your eyes, it's too late.

			<<if _grabbed>>
				<<if _checkResults[_attemptOne]>>
					The <<farm_text pig>> grasps your
					<<if _attemptOne is 0>> <<hairDetails>>
					<<elseif _attemptOne is 1>> _top.name
					<<else>> _bottom.name
					<</if>>
					and tries to pull you over the fence.

				<<else>>
					The <<farm_text pig>> lunges for your
					<<if _attemptTwo is 0>> <<hairDetails>>,
					<<elseif _attemptTwo is 1>> chest,
					<<else>> waist,
					<</if>>
					but fails to grab you.

					However, <<farm_he pig>> succeeds at grabbing your
					<<if _attemptTwo is 0>> <<hairDetails>>
					<<elseif _attemptTwo is 1>> _top.name
					<<else>> _bottom.name
					<</if>>
					and tries to pull you over the fence.
				<</if>>
				<br><br>

				You try to resist, but you feel too weak. You fall into the mud, and the <<farm_text pig>> takes full advantage of your vulnerability. <<farm_He pig>> tries to mount you.
				<br><br>

				<<link [[Next|Farm Pigs Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<if _attemptOne is _attemptTwo>>
					The <<farm_text pig>> lunges for your
					<<if _attemptTwo is 0>> <<hairDetails>>,
					<<elseif _attemptTwo is 1>> chest,
					<<else>> waist,
					<</if>>
					but fails to grab you. You push yourself away before <<farm_he pig>> can try again.

				<<else>>
					The <<farm_text pig>> lunges for your
					<<if _attemptTwo is 0>> <<hairDetails>>,
					<<elseif _attemptTwo is 1>> chest,
					<<else>> waist,
					<</if>>
					but fails to grab you.

					Frustrated, <<farm_he pig>> tries to grasp your
					<<if _attemptTwo is 0>> <<hairDetails>>,
					<<elseif _attemptOne is 1>> chest,
					<<else>> waist,
					<</if>>
					but you push yourself away before <<farm_he pig>> can reach you.
				<</if>>
				<<stress 6>><<gstress>>
				<br><br>
				<<link [[Next|Farm Work]]>><</link>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif ($settings.bestialityEnabled or $farm_work.pig.monster is true) and _grabbed>>
		<<if _checkResults[_attemptOne]>>
			<<set _firstSuccess to _attemptOne>>
		<<else>>
			<<set _firstSuccess to _attemptTwo>>
		<</if>>

		Something catches your
		<<if _firstSuccess is 0>> <<hairDetails>>
		<<elseif _firstSuccess is 1>> _top.name
		<<else>> _bottom.name
		<</if>>
		as you turn away from the trough.

		<<if $farm.beasts.pigs lte -20 and $rng gte 51>>
			One of the <<farm_text_many pig>> has reached over the fence.
			<<if $farm_work.pig.monster is true>>"You're not finished here," <<farm_he pig>> says. <</if>>
			<<farm_He pig>> tries to pull you inside.
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Scold|Farm Pigs Feed Extreme Scold]]>><</link>><<tendingdifficulty 1 1100>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Call for help|Farm Pigs Feed Extreme Help]]>><<npcincr Alex dom 1>><<farm_pigs -1>><</link>><<gdom "Alex">><<lrespect>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			One of the <<farm_text_many pig>> has stuck <<farm_his pig>> <<= $farm_work.pig.monster is true ? "arm" : "snout">> through the fence, and grasps your
			<<if _firstSuccess is 0>> hair
			<<else>> clothing
			<</if>>
			in <<farm_his pig>> <<= $farm_work.pig.monster is true ? "hand." : "mouth.">>
			<br><br>

			<<set $phase to _firstSuccess>>
			<<link [[Scold|Farm Pigs Feed Scold]]>><</link>><<tendingdifficulty 1 600>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Call for help|Farm Pigs Feed Help]]>><<npcincr Alex dom 1>><<farm_pigs -1>><</link>><<gdom "Alex">><<lrespect>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif _checkResults[3]>>
		As you turn away from the trough, you feel something brush against your
		<<if _attemptTwo is 0>> <<hairDetails>>.
		<<elseif _attemptTwo is 1 and _checkResults[1]>> _top.name.
		<<elseif _attemptTwo is 1>> chest.
		<<elseif _attemptTwo is 2 and _checkResults[2]>> _bottom.name.
		<<else>> waist.
		<</if>>
		<span class="teal">One of the <<farm_text_many pig>> just tried to grab you.</span>

		<<if _attemptOne is _attemptTwo>>
			Frustrated, <<farm_he pig>> reaches out again,
		<<else>>
			Frustrated, <<farm_he pig>> reaches out towards your
			<<if _attemptTwo is 0>> <<hairDetails>>,
			<<elseif _attemptTwo is 1 and _checkResults[1]>> _top.name,
			<<elseif _attemptTwo is 1>> chest,
			<<elseif _attemptTwo is 2 and _checkResults[2]>> _bottom.name,
			<<else>> waist,
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		but you smack away <<farm_his pig>> <<= $farm_work.pig.monster is true ? "arm." : "snout.">> "No! Bad <<farm_text pig>>!" you say,
		as the <<farm_text pig>> backs away. <<farm_He pig>> eyes you warily.<<farm_pigs 1>><<grespect>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Farm Work]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		As you turn away from the trough, a <<farm_text pig>> reaches out towards your
		<<if _attemptTwo is 0>> <<hairDetails>>.
		<<elseif _attemptTwo is 1 and _checkResults[1]>> _top.name.
		<<elseif _attemptTwo is 1>> chest.
		<<elseif _attemptTwo is 2 and _checkResults[2]>> _bottom.name.
		<<else>> waist.
		<</if>>
		You shiver at its expression.<<stress 6>><<gstress>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Farm Work]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Next|Farm Work]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Farm Pigs Feed Nausea
<<effects>><<set $weekly.farmNauseaEvent to true>>

"어이! 뭐-" 알렉스의 당황한 반응은 당신의 얼굴 표정을 보자마자 멈췄다. 당신은 몸을 돌려 앞으로 숙이고 무릎에 손을 얹었다. 목구멍에서 경련이 일어나는 것을 삼키려 애썼다. <<gpain>><<violence 3>>
<br><br>

<<if $farm_stage gte 7 and $alex_countdown is undefined>>
	갑자기, <<his>> 손이 <<if $hairlength gte 400>>당신의 머리카락을 뒤로 넘겨주고<</if>> 등을 부드럽게 원을 그리며 문지르는 것이 느껴졌다. "괜찮아, 파트너." 알렉스가 달래는 목소리로 속삭였다. "내가 있잖아."
	<br><br>

	몇 분 후, 속이 진정되어 다시 몸을 바로 세울 수 있었다. <<if $hairlength gte 400>>알렉스가 당신의 머리카락에서 손을 뗐지만, <<his>> 손은 당신의 등에 머물러 있었다. <<else>>알렉스의 손이 당신의 등에 머물러 있었다.<</if>> 그리고 <<he>>【이가】 당신의 얼굴을 들여다볼 때 <<his>> 시선은 걱정으로 가득했다.
	<br><br>

	<<His>> 손이 당신의 어깨를 더 꽉 잡았다. "이리 와." <<He>>【은는】 당신을 농장 집으로 이끌기 시작했다. "좀 쉬어야 해."

<<else>>
	몇 분 후, 속이 진정되어 다시 몸을 바로 세울 수 있었다. 돌아보니 알렉스가 예의상 고개를 돌린 채 기다리고 있었지만, 당신을 계속 주시하고 있었다는 것을 알 수 있었다. "저... 괜찮아?"
	<br><br>

	당신은 고개를 끄덕였지만, <<he>>【은는】 납득하지 못한 표정이었다. "이봐, 좀 쉬는 게 어때? 내가 차 끓여줄게."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"아, 아니에요, 괜찮아요." 당신이 말했다. "이제 괜찮아졌어요. 아직 도울 수 있어요."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"쉴 필요 없어요." 당신이 말했다. "어차피 할 일이 너무 많잖아요."
<<else>>
	"괜찮아요." 당신이 말했다. "계속 일할 수 있어요."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<He>>【은는】 당신의 항의를 무시하고 집으로 데려갔다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Farm Pigs Feed Nausea 2]]>><</link>>

:: Farm Pigs Feed Nausea 2
<<effects>>

<<He>> 당신을 소파에 앉히고는 부엌으로 들어갔다. 몇 분 후, 차 끓이는 냄새가 났다. <<He>>【은는】 당신에게 컵을 가져다주었다. 한 모금 마셔보니 평소보다 그리 진하지 않았다.
<br><br>

"난 돼지들 밥 마저 주러 갈게." 알렉스가 말했다. <<He>>【은는】 당신의 어깨를 부드럽게 쥐었다. "넌 여기서 좀 쉬고 있어."
<br><br>

당신은 부엌에서 잠시 쉬며 차를 마셨다. 짧은 휴식으로 기운을 차리고 다시 일하러 돌아갔다. <<gdom>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>><<npcincr Alex dom 1>><<stress -6>><<tiredness -4>>
<br><br>

<<endevent>>
<<link [[다음 (0:20)|Farm Work]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>

:: Farm Pigs In
<<effects>>

<<pigsOpinion>>

당신은 <<farm_text_many pig>>들을 돼지우리로 다시 몰아넣었다. 몇몇은 움직이기를 꺼리는 듯해서, 구슬려야 했다.

<<if _fullyNaked or dangerEvent(1.25)>>
   <<if $settings.bestialityEnabled or $farm_work.pig.monster is true>>
       당신은 간신히 마지막 녀석을 일으켜 세운다. 당신이 <<farm_him pig>>【을를】 안으로 이끌려 할 때, <<farm_he pig>>【이가】
